  "changelog": "SmartSaaS Skill v1.0.0 \u2014 initial release\n\n- Adds support for creating and managing datasets and items via shell scripts (create-dataset.sh, add-to-dataset.sh) using execute_shell only.\n- Requires explicit user instructions to add items; never auto-adds or infers items.\n- Installation is via extraDirs in openclaw.json, not clawhub.\n- Scripts use positional arguments only; do not use flags like --name or --dataset.\n- API credentials (SMARTSAAS_BASE_URL, SMARTSAAS_API_KEY) are read from the environment; users are never prompted to provide keys in chat.\n- All interactions are via provided scripts\u2014never via curl or direct HTTP requests.",
